    <font size=1><b>Date:</b> Sunday, March 24 @ 09:44:45 EST<br><b>Topic:</b> News/Annoucements<br><br>
    </center><font size=2>
    Today I have seen a beutiful thing, something I have not seen in a long time.<br /><br />This morning, Brothers guild accidently ganked Plane of Hate from an open raid held by Shadora. I was informed of the incident and made contact with the leader of Brothers, Sipar. <br /><br />Sipar was very appologetic, and after talking with him and clearing some things up I talked to Shadora, who was very forgiving. Understanding was reached, peace was made.<br /><br />Lately, I have seen much flaming and hating in general on these forums and in game. However, the understanding, maturity, and mutual respect shown by these two leaders has rejuvinated me with a new faith in our server and its amazing powers of unity.<br /><br />What is a server?? It is people. The <b>people</b> make and break who we are. By showing compashion, understanding, and above all RESPECT to the people you meet you build up the glory of Morell-Thule. By understanding the other guys point of view in your groups and raids YOU build up the glory of Morell-Thule. Let every person, every guild go forth in compashion, and understanding, and respect. Follow the example set by these two people, who barely even speak the same language, here today. In so doing you make your community a better, happier, and more stable place in which to live for yourself, your friends, your guild, and everyone. <br /><br /><i>Please direct all comments <a href=http://pub63.ezboard.com/fmorellthulecommunityforumsfrm1.showMessage?topicID=1673.topic>here</a>.</i><br><br>
